+        "fr": "Excuse-toi, à ta façon. C'est un point de bascule : ce qu'on lit, c'est ce que tu exprimes, jamais la qualité de ta phrase."
+       },
+       "listens_for": "What the learner expresses in the apology, never how well they say it. Path gate 3 (bible §7): naming what she means to them leans romance; naming the alliance, the team, leans friendship; a plain apology that names neither leaves the path where it is.",
